#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:9
msgid "OS 源码可移植性：现行架构"
msgstr "OS source portability: current architecture"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:11
msgid ""
"本页说明公共 OS 接口、静态内存与后端扩展如何连接。任务、通知、队列、关闭通道 和执行预算已在 FreeRTOS、ThreadX、Native "
"后端使用同一组公共符号；装配侧持有 选定后端的真实存储，业务只接收公共引用。实施与验收清单见 [交付清单](../development/os-"
"portability-plan.md)，调用要求见 [OS "
"执行合同](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md)和 "
"[后端接入合同](../reference/contracts/os/backend-integration.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This page explains how public OS interfaces, static memory and backend "
"extensions connect. Tasks, notifications, queues, closable channels and "
"execution budgets now use the same public symbols across the FreeRTOS, "
"ThreadX and Native backends. Assembly code owns actual storage for the "
"selected backend; business code receives only public references. See the "
"[delivery checklist](../development/os-portability-plan.md) for "
"implementation and acceptance, and the [OS execution "
"contract](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md) and [backend integration "
"contract](../reference/contracts/os/backend-integration.md) for calling "
"requirements."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:18
msgid ""
"公共消费链已有真实内核与外部示例的阶段验证。最终集成、ARM、资源和 SDK 资格 仍以绑定最终源码及配置的实际报告为准。源码可移植不表示二进制 "
"ABI、调度时序、 最小栈或所有内核特性相同；Host 执行不建立 MCU 实时性或实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"The public consumer chain has stage validation using real kernels and "
"external examples. Final integration, ARM, resource and SDK qualification "
"still requires actual reports bound to the final source and configuration. "
"Source portability does not imply identical binary ABIs, scheduling "
"behavior, minimum stacks or all kernel features. Host execution establishes "
"neither MCU real-time behavior nor physical-board qualification."

