#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:33
msgid ""
"接口合同、对象布局和构建选择分别维护。业务不需要命名原生 TCB，平台也不预留 跨内核最大对象、动态句柄表或通用对象池。现有内核算法继续由对应后端执行。"
msgstr ""
"Interface contracts, object layouts and build selection are maintained "
"separately. Business code need not name native TCBs. The platform reserves "
"no cross-kernel maximum objects, dynamic handle tables or common object "
"pools. Each backend continues to execute its existing kernel algorithms."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:36
msgid "依赖、职责与目录"
msgstr "Dependencies, responsibilities and directories"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:38
msgid "![FIG-27：当前 OS 构建依赖，单镜像只选择一个后端](../assets/diagrams/os-portability.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-27: current OS build dependencies, with one selected backend per "
"image](../assets/diagrams/os-portability.svg)"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:38
msgid "FIG-27：当前 OS 构建依赖，单镜像只选择一个后端"
msgstr ""
"FIG-27: current OS build dependencies, with one selected backend per image"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:40
msgid ""
"FIG-27 的身份是 current，每条箭头都表示构建期依赖，包含编译依赖和链接时的实现 "
"选择，不表示启动顺序、每次运行调用或所有权转移。图中的后端是互斥选择； 应用不会同时链接三个同名 OS 实现。 图只覆盖任务后端，不包含裸机路径。普通 "
"I/O 不强制经过 OS， 也不新增运行期 factory、worker 或对象池。"
msgstr ""
"FIG-27 is a current diagram. Every arrow denotes a build-time dependency, "
"including compilation dependencies and implementation selection at link "
"time; it does not denote startup order, every runtime call or ownership "
"transfer. The backends shown are mutually exclusive choices: an application "
"does not link three OS implementations with the same symbols. The diagram "
"covers only task backends, not the Baremetal path. Ordinary I/O is not "
"forced through the OS, and no runtime factory, worker or object pool is "
"added."

