#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:55
msgid ""
"该划分对应 SOLID：接口与存储各有单一变化原因；新增后端实现同一合同；只有满足 "
"合同的能力才能替换；小接口分离基础与可选能力；组件依赖公共端口。它不要求为 每个函数增加接口层，也不允许以 `UNSUPPORTED` "
"掩盖已声明能力的缺失。"
msgstr ""
"This division follows SOLID: interfaces and storage each have a single "
"reason to change; new backends implement the same contract; only "
"capabilities that satisfy the contract are substitutable; small interfaces "
"separate basic and optional capabilities; and components depend on public "
"ports. It does not require another interface layer for every function, or "
"permit `UNSUPPORTED` to hide missing capabilities that a backend has "
"declared."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:59
msgid "当前目录保留公共声明、选定存储布局和实际后端实现，按职责分文件。"
msgstr ""
"The current directories separate public declarations, selected storage "
"layouts and actual backend implementations. Files follow their "
"responsibilities."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:76
msgid ""
"FreeRTOS 的 `task_runtime.c` 实现内核启动、读时钟、延时与 yield，普通对象算法 保留在 "
"`freertos.c`；ThreadX 与 Native 分别由自己的 C 实现承担。每个任务后端 通过 include 路径提供同名 "
"`nexus/os/detail/backend_storage.h`，而不是依靠整仓 配置宏选择布局；真实 RTOS 的 Host "
"夹具因此也能取得正确存储。现有 MPU、Secure、 端口准备工具与锁定依赖继续归后端维护，Host 脚本不进入固件、不修改 vendor。"
msgstr ""
"FreeRTOS `task_runtime.c` implements kernel entry, clock reads, sleep and "
"yield, while ordinary object algorithms remain in `freertos.c`. ThreadX and "
"Native use their own C implementations. Each task backend provides the same "
"`nexus/os/detail/backend_storage.h` path through its include directories, "
"rather than selecting layouts through repository-wide configuration macros. "
"Real RTOS Host fixtures therefore receive the correct storage too. Existing "
"MPU, Secure, port preparation tools and locked dependencies remain with "
"their backend. Host scripts do not enter firmware or modify vendor "
"originals."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:82
msgid "编译期选择与静态存储"
msgstr "Compile-time selection and static storage"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:84
msgid ""
"公共函数在各后端具有相同符号，CMake 每次只选择一个实现。无需 `switch(os_type)`、通用 ops "
"表、运行期名称查找或动态对象池。保留 `nx_wait_port_t` 的 callback，是因为组件需要连接具体通知对象，与整幅镜像 "
"选择内核是不同问题；不再包一层通知 vtable。"
msgstr ""
"Public functions use the same symbols across backends, with CMake selecting "
"just one implementation. No `switch(os_type)`, common ops table, runtime "
"name lookup or dynamic object pool is needed. The callbacks in "
"`nx_wait_port_t` remain because components must connect to specific "
"notification objects, which is distinct from selecting the kernel for an "
"entire image. No further notification vtable is added."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:89
msgid ""
"业务头只看到未完成类型及引用。装配文件包含选定布局头，才能定义实际存储； 同一对象直接形成业务引用，不额外分配一个只保存指针的包装对象。 "
"原生控制块头可以成为装配文件的编译依赖，但不进入业务头。"
msgstr ""
"Business headers see only incomplete types and references. Assembly files "
"include the selected layout header to define actual storage. The same object"
" directly supplies the business reference, without another allocated wrapper"
" that holds only a pointer. Native control-block headers may be compilation "
"dependencies of assembly files, but do not enter business headers."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:93
msgid ""
"以下片段来自三后端实际共用的 C11 消费者：两步操作共用一个绝对预算，业务不包含 内核分支。它不包含对象装配、内核启动和退出流程，不是完整 "
"`main` 教程。"
msgstr ""
"The following fragment comes from the actual C11 consumer shared across the "
"three backends. Both operations share one absolute budget, with no kernel "
"branches in business code. It omits object assembly, kernel startup and "
"shutdown, and is not a complete `main` tutorial."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:102
msgid ""
"装配侧用 [storage.h](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/include/nexus/os/storage.h) 和 `NX_OS_STACK_DEFINE` "
"定义实际对象与栈；业务侧只需要相应公共头。"
msgstr ""
"Assembly code uses [storage.h](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/include/nexus/os/storage.h) and"
" `NX_OS_STACK_DEFINE` to define actual objects and stacks. Business code "
"needs only the corresponding public headers."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:105
msgid ""
"栈容量对外以 B 表示。后端检查对齐、启动帧、容量溢出和原生单位换算；TCB、 任务上下文、同步对象和队列数据区由外部 owner "
"持有。布局由真实选定类型决定， 不维护另一套手写 sizeof，不预留跨内核最大 union，不把固定字节数组当通用 TCB。 "
"选择不同内核或配置后必须重新编译，并重新核对 `sizeof`、alignment 和预算。"
msgstr ""
"Stack capacity is expressed externally in B. Backends check alignment, "
"startup frames, capacity overflow and conversion to native units. The "
"external owner holds TCBs, task contexts, synchronization objects and queue "
"data areas. Layouts follow the actual selected types: there is no second "
"handwritten sizeof authority, no cross-kernel maximum union, and no fixed "
"byte array used as a universal TCB. Changing the kernel or configuration "
"requires recompilation and a fresh check of `sizeof`, alignment and budgets."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:110
msgid ""
"硬件选择沿用 TOML、typed IR 和 CMake 单一路径。软件消费者在显式建立装配后， 用 "
"`nexus_require_os_capabilities` 校验 `Nexus::OS` 的能力，再显式链接该目标； "
"校验函数不创建对象、不代替链接、不复制一份 TOML 能力清单。 后端发布 `NEXUS_OS_BACKEND` 兼容身份，CMake "
"拒绝一幅镜像混入不同任务后端。 裸机不冒充任务实现，真实 Host 内核端口也不声明硬件 IRQ 发布能力。"
msgstr ""
"Hardware selection retains the single TOML, typed IR and CMake path. After "
"explicitly creating an assembly, software consumers use "
"`nexus_require_os_capabilities` to validate `Nexus::OS` capabilities, then "
"explicitly link that target. Validation neither creates objects nor replaces"
" linking or duplicates a capability list in TOML. Backends publish the "
"compatible identity `NEXUS_OS_BACKEND`; CMake rejects mixing different task "
"backends in one image. Baremetal does not impersonate a task implementation,"
" and real Host kernel ports do not declare hardware IRQ publication "
"capability."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:116
msgid ""
"这里不新增 Kconfig、缓存回退或独立 MCU 注册表。新 MCU 若复用已有 CPU/内核 合同，提供 SoC、IRQ、时钟和 Board "
"事实即可；新端口或新语义才修改 OS 集成。"
msgstr ""
"This adds no Kconfig, cache fallback or separate MCU registry. A new MCU "
"reusing an existing CPU/kernel contract supplies SoC, IRQ, clock and Board "
"facts. Only a new port or new semantics require OS integration changes."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:119
msgid "通用能力与可选扩展"
msgstr "Common capabilities and optional extensions"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:121
msgid ""
"本页的任务能力集合覆盖 FreeRTOS、ThreadX 和 Native 公共实现，不是新增的 TOML "
"配置键。裸机只保留非阻塞机制；任务、关闭和优先级等需求通过实际目标能力校验。 永久任务与可返回任务、普通队列与关闭通道分别承担各自的存储成本。"
msgstr ""
"The task capability set on this page covers the public FreeRTOS, ThreadX and"
" Native implementations; it is not a new TOML configuration key. Baremetal "
"retains only nonblocking mechanisms. Task, close and priority requirements "
"are validated against actual target capabilities. Permanent versus "
"returnable tasks, and ordinary queues versus closable channels, carry their "
"respective storage costs."

