msgstr "Basic queue"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "固定 item size/depth、复制、有限等待"
msgstr "Fixed item size/depth, copying and bounded waits"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "控制对象和 `depth * item_size` 数据区"
