#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "可关闭通道"
msgstr "Closable channel"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "关闭发送准入、广播退出、保留已有数据排空"
msgstr ""
"Close send admission, broadcast shutdown and retain existing data for "
"draining"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "额外 waiter 存储与广播成本"
msgstr "Additional waiter storage and broadcast cost"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:134
msgid ""
"本批没有公共 mutex／semaphore 接口。OSU-21 盘点确认：现有生产组件通过窄端口 注入同步，未直接依赖跨 OS mutex 或计数 "
"semaphore；当前消费链由通知、队列与 channel 满足。OSU-22／23 因此明确不纳入，不创建空头或宣称已支持。原生内核 "
"已有这些功能，不等于 Nexus 已提供相应公共合同。"
msgstr ""
"This batch provides no public mutex/semaphore interface. The OSU-21 "
"inventory confirmed that current production components inject "
"synchronization through narrow ports and do not directly depend on cross-OS "
"mutexes or counting semaphores. Notifications, queues and channels satisfy "
"the current consumer chain. OSU-22/23 are therefore explicitly excluded, "
"with no empty headers or support claims. Existing native-kernel "
"functionality does not mean Nexus provides the corresponding public "
"contract."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:139
msgid ""
"FreeRTOS 直接通知槽、ThreadX 抢占阈值、MPU 受限任务和 Secure 上下文属于显式 "
"扩展。应用选择这些能力就接受对应装配的移植成本；不能让普通组件私自依赖它们。 不默认引入软件 timer daemon、事件派发线程或通用 user-"
"object pool。"
msgstr ""
"FreeRTOS direct-notification slots, ThreadX preemption thresholds, MPU "
"restricted tasks and Secure contexts are explicit extensions. Applications "
"selecting them accept the corresponding assembly migration cost; ordinary "
"components must not introduce undeclared dependencies on them. No software "
"timer daemon, event dispatch thread or general user-object pool is "
"introduced by default."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:143
msgid "任务、启动与回收"
msgstr "Tasks, startup and reclamation"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:145
msgid ""
"任务接口统一入口签名、可返回/永久分类和结果语义。start 成功后任务可能已经 执行，甚至在 start 返回前结束；context "
"和必要连接必须先准备完成。 创建被拒绝时不保留 entry/context。若底层部分资源未能撤回，必须返回明确的残余 "
"责任并保留控制对象，不能把它描述成可立即重用的干净拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"The task interface unifies entry signatures, returnable/permanent categories"
" and result semantics. A task may already be executing after start succeeds,"
" or may even finish before start returns; its context and required "
"connections must be prepared first. Rejected creation retains no "
"entry/context references. If some underlying resources cannot be withdrawn, "
"the result must identify residual responsibility and retain the control "
"object; it must not describe this as a clean rejection permitting immediate "
"reuse."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:150
msgid ""
"可返回任务的入口返回只表示业务结束。FreeRTOS 外部删除、ThreadX 的真实删除、 pthread join "
"由后端实现；共同成功条件是内核与适配层已解除对应引用。 join 超时不强杀任务，不释放栈、TCB 或 context；self-join 和竞争 "
"join 被拒绝。 不提供一个声称能安全撤销所有业务效果的通用 task-kill。"
msgstr ""
"A returnable task entry returning means only that its business work has "
"ended. The backend implements external FreeRTOS deletion, actual ThreadX "
"deletion or pthread join. Success requires the kernel and adapter to have "
"detached the corresponding references. A join timeout neither kills the task"
" nor frees its stack, TCB or context. Self-join and competing joins are "
"rejected. There is no generic task-kill claiming to safely undo all business"
" effects."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:155
msgid ""
"`nx_os_run` 接受明确的 bootstrap 回调，成功进入后不返回。FreeRTOS 在回调后 启动真实 scheduler；ThreadX"
" 在实际 `tx_application_define` 范围执行回调； Native 执行回调后停驻调用线程，保留其栈，不创建隐藏 "
"coordinator。 各内核不伪装相同的引导状态；bootstrap 只完成声明允许的非阻塞构造与连接。 "
"平台启动仍不启动调度器，不允许将已运行内核重新解释成冷态 bootstrap。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_os_run` accepts an explicit bootstrap callback and does not return after"
" successful entry. FreeRTOS starts the real scheduler after the callback; "
"ThreadX executes it within the actual `tx_application_define` scope. Native "
"parks the calling thread after the callback, preserving its stack without "
"creating a hidden coordinator. Kernels do not pretend to have identical "
"bootstrap states. Bootstrap performs only declared nonblocking construction "
"and connection operations. Platform startup still does not start the "
"scheduler, and a running kernel must not be reinterpreted as a cold "
"bootstrap."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:161
msgid ""
"Native 有限 join 先尝试 `pthread_tryjoin_np`，再用 "
"`pthread_clockjoin_np(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, ...)` 共享同一截止时间。 构建使用真实链接探针检查这两项 GNU "
"能力，缺失时拒绝 Native 任务配置。 只有显式 `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` 使用无期限 join；入口完成提示不能代替 pthread"
" 实际退出，不在有限等待后偷偷调用无界 join。"
msgstr ""
"Bounded Native join first tries `pthread_tryjoin_np`, then uses "
"`pthread_clockjoin_np(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, ...)` with the same deadline. A real "
"link probe checks both GNU capabilities during configuration, rejecting "
"Native task configuration when they are absent. Only explicit "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` uses an unbounded join. Entry-completion hints do not "
"replace actual pthread exit, and bounded waits never silently fall through "
"to unbounded join."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:167
msgid "队列、通道和同步语义"
msgstr "Queue, channel and synchronization semantics"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:169
msgid ""
"基础队列不承担关闭广播。发送成功表示队列已复制 item，接收成功才交付 item； 超时或关闭拒绝不能偷偷消费 item，也不能在失败时改写接收输出。"
" 排队指针只复制指针，payload 的借用与回收仍由调用者协议负责。"
msgstr ""
"Basic queues do not bear close-broadcast costs. A successful send means the "
"queue has copied the item; only a successful receive delivers an item. A "
"timeout or close rejection must not silently consume an item or modify "
"receive output on failure. Queueing a pointer copies only that pointer; the "
"caller protocol still owns payload borrowing and reclamation."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:173
msgid ""
"可关闭通道复用现有正确性要求：close 后拒绝新发送，唤醒已登记阻塞者，旧 item 仍可接收，排空后接收返回关闭结果。控制对象、每个并发 "
"waiter 和数据区都由 调用者提供；destroy 要求 closed、drained 且 users/publishers 已退出。 close "
"和 destroy 不替代执行 owner 推进；不能以定期超时检查代替关闭唤醒。"
msgstr ""
"Closable channels retain existing correctness requirements: after close, new"
" sends are rejected, registered blockers are woken, existing items remain "
"receivable, and receive reports closure once drained. Callers provide the "
"control object, every concurrent waiter and the data area. Destroy requires "
"closed, drained state and exited users/publishers. Close and destroy do not "
"replace execution-owner progress, and periodic timeout checks must not "
"substitute for close wakeups."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:178
msgid ""
"通知与通道都需要等待者和发布者实际退出，才能销毁；销毁失败保留未解除的资源， 只允许受审重试。应用若明确选择原生同步扩展，仍需自行维护 "
"owner、计数和优先级 协议，不能用普通 binary semaphore 冒充优先级继承 mutex。"
msgstr ""
"Notification and channel waiters and publishers must actually exit before "
"destruction. Destruction failures retain unreleased resources and permit "
"only reviewed retries. Applications explicitly selecting native "
"synchronization extensions still own their owner, count and priority "
"protocols; an ordinary binary semaphore must not masquerade as a priority-"
"inheritance mutex."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:182
msgid "时间、优先级与上下文"
msgstr "Time, priorities and context"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:184
msgid ""
"有限等待保持现有绝对单调微秒合同；后端向上换算 tick，跨唤醒重算剩余预算。 无限等待只能显式选择 "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`；溢出不能降为无限。立即可满足的 操作可先成功，等待错误后仍按公共 Wait 合同重查真实条件。 "
"时间域必须在等待、排空和 join 期间连续；重启 epoch 后旧 deadline 失效。"
msgstr ""
"Bounded waits retain the existing absolute monotonic-microsecond contract. "
"Backends round tick conversions upward and recompute the remaining budget "
"across wakeups. Infinite waits require explicit `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`; "
"overflow must not turn into infinity. An immediately satisfiable operation "
"may succeed first, and the authoritative predicate is still rechecked after "
"wait errors under the public Wait contract. The time domain must remain "
"continuous through waiting, draining and join; restarting the epoch "
"invalidates old deadlines."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:189
msgid ""
"`task.h` 提供 task-only 的 `nx_sleep_until` 和 `nx_task_yield`。 `nx_sleep_until`"
" 使用 `nx_os_now_us` 的同域绝对 deadline，过期立即返回，拒绝 "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`，不推进设备、不保证微秒唤醒精度。Native 的 OS 时钟始终是 真实 "
"`CLOCK_MONOTONIC`，不能混用可切换的硬件模型时钟。`nx_task_yield` 只提出 "
"调度提示，不保证公平、指定下一任务或让低优先级任务运行，两者不隐建 timer worker。"
msgstr ""
"`task.h` provides task-only `nx_sleep_until` and `nx_task_yield`. "
"`nx_sleep_until` uses an absolute deadline in the `nx_os_now_us` domain, "
"returns immediately on expiry, rejects `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`, does not service"
" devices and does not guarantee microsecond wake precision. The Native OS "
"clock is always real `CLOCK_MONOTONIC`; do not mix it with a switchable "
"hardware-model clock. `nx_task_yield` is only a scheduling hint, "
"guaranteeing neither fairness, a specific next task nor execution of a "
"lower-priority task. Neither operation creates an implicit timer worker."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:195
msgid ""
"公共逻辑优先级数值越大越高。FreeRTOS 保持同向编号，ThreadX 反向映射；可用 等级由所选存储头的 "
"`NX_OS_PRIORITY_LEVELS` 表示。Native 只接受逻辑值 0， 其他值拒绝，不忽略参数；它不声明 `priority` "
"能力，也不声称普通 pthread 调度 具有 MCU 抢占保证。应用装配显式选择优先级与栈预算。"
msgstr ""
"Public logical priority increases with its numeric value. FreeRTOS retains "
"the same direction; ThreadX reverses its native numbering. The selected "
"storage header exposes the available levels as `NX_OS_PRIORITY_LEVELS`. "
"Native accepts only logical value 0 and rejects other values rather than "
"ignoring them. It does not declare the `priority` capability or claim that "
"ordinary pthread scheduling provides MCU preemption guarantees. Application "
"assembly explicitly selects priorities and stack budgets."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "上下文"
msgstr "Context"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "当前准入"
msgstr "Current admission"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "普通 task"
msgstr "Ordinary task"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "已运行的正确内核、受支持权限和屏蔽状态；阻塞只在允许阶段"
msgstr ""
"Correct running kernel, supported privilege and mask state; blocking only in"
" permitted phases"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "Bootstrap"
msgstr "Bootstrap"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "允许受审的构造、未执行任务撤回与通知发布；队列/channel 传输仍拒绝"
msgstr ""
"Reviewed construction, unused-task withdrawal and notification publication "
"are permitted; queue/channel transfers remain rejected"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "IRQ 发布"
msgstr "IRQ publication"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "独立入口，先核验 IRQ 范围、mask、分组与 syscall ceiling"
msgstr ""
"Separate entry; first validate IRQ range, masks, grouping and syscall "
"ceiling"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "NMI / fault / 其他安全域"
msgstr "NMI / fault / other security domains"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "不继承普通 IRQ 合同，未维护的组合拒绝"
msgstr ""
"Does not inherit the ordinary IRQ contract; reject unmaintained combinations"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "MPU 用户任务"
msgstr "MPU user task"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "仅受审 syscall；公共名称不自动授予原生内核或 I/O 权限"
msgstr ""
"Reviewed syscalls only; public names do not automatically grant native-"
"kernel or I/O privileges"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:208
msgid ""
"本批不提供 ISR 队列/channel 传输；IRQ 通过明确通知入口发布提示，不调用阻塞操作。 实际 IRQ 原语继续保存/恢复 incoming "
"mask，不用本地关中断声称获得 SMP、DMA 或跨安全域互斥。Secure companion 不增加第二个 "
"scheduler，信任边界保持原合同。"
msgstr ""
"This batch provides no ISR queue/channel transfer. IRQs publish hints "
"through explicit notification entry points and do not call blocking "
"operations. Actual IRQ primitives continue to save/restore incoming masks. "
"Disabling local interrupts does not establish SMP, DMA or cross-security-"
"domain exclusion. The Secure companion adds no second scheduler, and the "
"trust boundary remains governed by the original contract."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:212
msgid "结果、停止与失败责任"
msgstr "Results, stopping and failure responsibility"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:214
msgid ""
"公共接口沿用 Core 结果类型，不另建 OS 错误枚举；准确码值及输出规则由公共头 "
"维护。参数与上下文拒绝发生在对象和内核效果变更前；内核错误不撤销已经发布的 通知提示，调用者仍须重查真实条件，不能据错误返回提前回收借用。"
msgstr ""
"Public interfaces retain Core result types rather than adding another OS "
"error enumeration. Public headers govern exact codes and output rules. "
"Argument and context rejection precede object changes or kernel effects. "
"Kernel errors do not undo notification hints already published: callers must"
" still recheck authoritative predicates and must not reclaim loans early "
"because an error was returned."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "结果类别"
msgstr "Result category"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "存储和后续责任"
msgstr "Storage and subsequent responsibility"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "参数/上下文拒绝"
msgstr "Argument/context rejection"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "不取得新的业务借用，不执行内核操作"
msgstr "No new business loans or kernel operations"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "必需能力不满足"
msgstr "Required capability not satisfied"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "配置失败；动态扩展另按明确接口拒绝，不偷偷选择替代模式"
msgstr ""
"Configuration fails; dynamic extensions reject under their explicit "
"interfaces, without silently selecting a replacement mode"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "等待超时"
msgstr "Wait timeout"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "结束本次等待；保留任务、请求和其他未结束借用"
msgstr "End this wait; retain tasks, requests and other outstanding loans"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "通道关闭"
msgstr "Channel closure"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "停止发送准入；继续 drain 和等待者退出"
msgstr "Stop send admission; continue draining and waiter exit"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "忙/尚未退出"
msgstr "Busy/not yet exited"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "保留同一存储，继续必要进度，不能重新 init"
msgstr ""
"Retain the same storage and continue necessary progress; no reinitialization"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "部分清理失败"
msgstr "Partial cleanup failure"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:96
msgid "保留精确残余资源和恢复责任，不伪报 destroy 成功"
msgstr ""
"Retain exact residual resources and recovery responsibility; do not falsely "
"report successful destroy"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:227
msgid ""
"![FIG-08：当前等待、真实条件重查与外部退出责任](../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-08: current waiting, authoritative predicate recheck and external "
"shutdown responsibilities](../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:227
msgid "FIG-08：当前等待、真实条件重查与外部退出责任"
msgstr ""
"FIG-08: current waiting, authoritative predicate recheck and external "
"shutdown responsibilities"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:229
msgid ""
"FIG-08 表达现行等待协议与退出责任。请求 SETTLED、 任务入口完成、join 成功、通知发布者退出分别证明不同事实。应用先关准入，继续 执行"
" owner 的取消/排空，再会合有关任务和 IRQ 发布路径。通知和队列只在全部 相关发布者与等待者会合后销毁。平台时钟与 Tick "
"保留到全部消费者静默且所选内核 生命周期允许撤回；不能在内核运行时直接撤销，也不承诺当前支持 scheduler "
"shutdown。失败时保留尚未结清的引用，不把 timeout/cancel 当作存储释放。"
msgstr ""
"FIG-08 expresses the current waiting protocol and shutdown responsibilities."
" Request SETTLED, task-entry completion, successful join and notification-"
"publisher exit each prove distinct facts. Applications first close "
"admission, keep the execution owner progressing cancellation/drain, then "
"join the relevant tasks and IRQ publication paths. Notifications and queues "
"are destroyed only after all relevant publishers and waiters have quiesced "
"and been joined. Platform clocks and Tick remain until every consumer is "
"quiescent and the selected kernel lifecycle permits withdrawal. They must "
"not simply be withdrawn while the kernel is running, and current scheduler "
"shutdown support is not promised. Failures retain outstanding references; "
"timeout/cancel does not release storage."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:236
msgid "成本、参考与验收边界"
msgstr "Costs, references and acceptance boundaries"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:238
msgid ""
"编译期共同符号避免额外后端分派，但统一合同仍可能需要完成状态、deadline 换算或上下文检查。精简对象按能力选用；未选择的 "
"channel、trace、MPU 与 Secure 状态不得进入普通对象。报告分别列对象、栈、payload、内核全局状态、 Flash 和总保留 "
"RAM，不用单个 `sizeof` 代表整幅镜像。"
msgstr ""
"Common compile-time symbols avoid additional backend dispatch, but the "
"unified contract may still require completion state, deadline conversion or "
"context checks. Select lean objects by capability. Unselected channel, "
"trace, MPU and Secure state must not enter ordinary objects. Reports "
"separately list objects, stacks, payloads, kernel-global state, Flash and "
"total retained RAM; a single `sizeof` does not represent the entire image."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:243
msgid ""
"现有 [Wait 成本夹具](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_wait_cost/README.md)与 "
"[资源夹具](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_resources/README.md)是当前比较入口，不能 把其旧结果标成新 API 的证据。实际"
" IRQ 延迟、栈峰值、FP/MVE 保留和低功耗时间 连续性仍需设备验证；本文不新增当前支持或 HIL 结论。"
msgstr ""
"The existing [Wait cost fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_wait_cost/README.md) and [resource "
"fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_resources/README.md) provide current comparison "
"entry points. Their old results must not be relabeled as evidence for new "
"APIs. Actual IRQ latency, stack peaks, FP/MVE retention and low-power time "
"continuity still require device validation. This page adds no current "
"support or HIL conclusions."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:248
msgid ""
"[CMSIS-RTOS2 官方接口](https://arm-"
"software.github.io/CMSIS_6/latest/RTOS2/index.html) "
"说明共同线程/同步接口与调用者存储属性可以并存，值得借鉴术语与上下文规则。 但 CMSIS 接口存在不证明某个内核有合格实现，也不能替代 Nexus "
"的绝对 deadline、 外部 join、借用和关闭合同。当前没有引入 CMSIS-RTOS2 中间层，内核 pin 保持原样。"
msgstr ""
"The [official CMSIS-RTOS2 interface](https://arm-"
"software.github.io/CMSIS_6/latest/RTOS2/index.html) shows that common "
"thread/synchronization interfaces can coexist with caller-provided storage "
"attributes. Its terminology and context rules are useful references. The "
"existence of a CMSIS interface does not prove a qualified implementation for"
" a kernel, or replace Nexus absolute deadlines, external join, borrowing and"
" close contracts. No CMSIS-RTOS2 middleware layer has been added, and "
"existing kernel pins remain unchanged."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:253
msgid ""
"普通后端公开入口已经迁入公共接口，不保留旧 alias、兼容 wrapper 或 fallback； 明确扩展继续保留后端名称。阶段验证执行真实生产 C"
" 路径及同一 C11 消费者， 但不代替最终完整集成、ARM、资源或独立 SDK 验收。当前工作包及退出条件由 "
"[交付清单](../development/os-portability-plan.md)维护，未执行 HIL 仍是 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary backend public entry points have migrated to common interfaces, "
"without old aliases, compatibility wrappers or fallbacks. Explicit "
"extensions retain backend-specific names. Stage validation executes actual "
"production C paths and the same C11 consumer, but does not replace final "
"complete integration, ARM, resource or independent SDK acceptance. The "
"[delivery checklist](../development/os-portability-plan.md) maintains "
"current work packages and exit conditions. Unexecuted HIL remains "
"`not_executed`."
